21) NOTES FOR THE REPORT
============================================================

# Official dataset:
# AGO2_CLASH_Hejret2023 (test)
# 1018 samples
# 523 negatives
# 495 positives

# TargetNet official reproduction:
# AP = 0.5533
# ROC-AUC = 0.5695
# (The classification metrics depend on the chosen threshold.)

# TargetNet AP = 0.5533 matches the published miRBench value
# 0.5533 for this test split.

# Threshold-dependent metrics:
# Accuracy = (TP + TN) / (TP + TN + FP + FN)
# Precision = TP / (TP + FP)
# Recall / Sensitivity = TP / (TP + FN)
# Specificity = TN / (TN + FP)
# F1 = 2 * Precision * Recall / (Precision + Recall)

# Threshold-independent metrics:
# AP and ROC-AUC are calculated from continuous prediction scores
# and do not depend on threshold 0.5 or 0.7.

# IMPORTANT FOR RNACOFOLD:
# RNAcofold produces an energy/MFE-related score, not necessarily
# a probability like TargetNet. Make sure the exact score transformation
# used in your miRBench RNACofold implementation is documented before
# comparing numerical AP/ROC-AUC values across tools.


